      "message": "ACK on merging it there, but please note that this config file is no longer used for developing the kernel, as we\u0027ve switched to kleaf. This has few implications:\n\n1. The `arch/(x86|arm64)/configs/gki_defconfig` should be updated instead (both of them)\n2. The change will **have to be upstream** to `android-mainline` or otherwise we won\u0027t be able to apply this change.\n\nWe can accept this divergence for `android15-6.6-desktop` for `gki_defconfig` files, but I would recommend with attempting to upstream this change first, and then backport it to this branch (and to `android16-6.12`) from the `android-mainline`. That will show us if this kind of config change will be accepted by the Android team for arms, and if not, find alternative, upstreamable solution.",
